{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108688","id":2672256410,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6fR2Wa","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108688","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108688.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108688.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108688","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108688/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108688/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108688/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7bc00ad2de97c7b3123860a9f12ac19a4e39a9b9","number":108688,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"VideoStreamPlayer: Fix calling seek(0) from stop()","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The docs say that `VideoStreamPlayer::stop` should set the stream position to 0, while `VideoStreamPlayback::_stop`  shouldn't. Now it's actually being done in VideoStreamPlayback.\r\n\r\nI've changed it in accordance with the docs. It makes more sense, and it allows more control to VideoStreamPlayer, avoiding some unnecessary seeks. Calling `set_stream` would seek to 0 in the current video stream before loading the new one.\r\n\r\nIt also fixes an issue raised by #108600 when re-importing a video that would result in an unnecessary seek on a video file that was being replaced by the import and caused the editor to freeze.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga